#
# Semantic content of the header page: values, relations and properties.
# The presence of each name and type comes with the Tier 0 generator.

assertion  XBD.iso646.h.001
anchor     basedefs/iso646.h.html#DESCRIPTION/and
class      required
says       The eleven macros and, and_eq, bitand, bitor, compl, not, not_eq, or,
           or_eq, xor and xor_eq expand to the tokens &&, &=, &, |, ~, !, !=, ||,
           |=, ^ and ^=.
test       t/001-spellings.c
nomutant   run-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants

assertion  XBD.iso646.h.002
anchor     basedefs/iso646.h.html#DESCRIPTION/and
class      required
says       The alternative spellings work as the operators they stand for, in
           expressions and in #if.
test       t/002-operators.c
nomutant   run-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants
